#: ../../source/docs/common-holybro-kakutef4.rst:51
#: 2f97577b843340438afce2901a847750
msgid ""
"The UARTs are marked Rn and Tn in the above pinouts. The Rn pin is the "
"receive pin for UARTn. The Tn pin is the transmit pin for UARTn."
msgstr "上述引脚图中 UART 标记为 Rn 和 Tn。Rn 引脚为 UARTn 的接收引脚，Tn 引脚为 UARTn 的发送引脚。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-holybro-kakutef4.rst:54
#: cbbc64b25ece4e27902f71a377dda4a0
msgid ""
"The pin labeled Rx on each corner of the board is a common pin for ESC "
"telemetry input."
msgstr "板子四角标注为 Rx 的引脚是 ESC 数传输入的公共引脚。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-holybro-kakutef4.rst:57
#: fb75312a2fb245b1b4e3bac67556157a
msgid "SERIAL0 -> USB"
msgstr "SERIAL0 -> USB"

