msgstr "SERIAL5 -> UART3（RX 用于 RC 输入，仅 TX）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-holybro-kakutef4.rst:65
#: 6d8fe41bc9ed4ac089ec150598568600
msgid "RC Input"
msgstr "RC 输入"

#: ../../source/docs/common-holybro-kakutef4.rst:67
#: a13edd98ab5e47a4bb9706a9dae22151
msgid ""
"The R3 pin, which by default is mapped to a timer input, can be used for all"
" ArduPilot supported receiver protocols, except CRSF/ELRS and SRXL2 which "
"require a true UART connection. However, FPort, when connected in this "
"manner, will only provide RC without telemetry."
msgstr ""
"R3 引脚默认映射为定时器输入，可用于所有 ArduPilot 支持的接收机协议，但 CRSF/ELRS 和 SRXL2 除外（它们需要真正的 UART"
" 连接）。但以此方式连接的 FPort 只能提供 RC 信号而无数传。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-holybro-kakutef4.rst:69
#: 8d1a45de36e64118b51f2c5d4c155305
msgid "PPM/SBUS/DSM/SRXL attach to R3 pin."
msgstr "PPM/SBUS/DSM/SRXL 连接到 R3 引脚。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-holybro-kakutef4.rst:70
#: 8f5f2b6046b847a18306708d2db9868e
msgid "FPort must use UART6 or UART4. See :ref:`common-FPort-receivers`."
msgstr "FPort 必须使用 UART6 或 UART4。请参见 :ref:`common-FPort-receivers`。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-holybro-kakutef4.rst:71
#: 59d4193ec83e46d096d140404cf8c790
msgid ""
"CRSF must use UART6 or UART4 for RC and Telemetry. See :ref:`common-tbs-rc`."
msgstr "CRSF 必须使用 UART6 或 UART4 进行 RC 和数传。请参见 :ref:`common-tbs-rc`。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-holybro-kakutef4.rst:72
#: c6ae5ed4e9da4fc68a8fdd0ec2614742
msgid ""
"SRXL2 must use UART6 or UART4 for both RC and Telemetry. See :ref:`common-"
"spektrum-rc`."
msgstr "SRXL2 必须使用 UART6 或 UART4 进行 RC 和数传。请参见 :ref:`common-spektrum-rc`。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-holybro-kakutef4.rst:75
#: 05841e31d0c146abac69895f09d144db
msgid "FrSky Telemetry"
msgstr "FrSky 数传"

#: ../../source/docs/common-holybro-kakutef4.rst:77
#: 0828cf901993491fa57130d9b7ac5840
msgid ""
"FrSky Telemetry is supported using the SmartPort pad (UART1). You need to "
"set the following parameters to enable support for FrSky S.PORT. It has "
"built-in inverters and a diode to allow for operation from a single pin with"
" no special adapters."
msgstr ""
"FrSky 数传通过 SmartPort 焊盘（UART1）支持。需要设置以下参数以启用对 FrSky S.PORT "
"的支持。内置反相器和二极管，允许从单引脚操作，无需特殊适配器。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-holybro-kakutef4.rst:82
#: f2e36aea6998404d8a2ad9a229851845
msgid ":ref:`SERIAL2_PROTOCOL<SERIAL2_PROTOCOL>` 4 or 10"
msgstr ":ref:`SERIAL2_PROTOCOL<SERIAL2_PROTOCOL>` 4 或 10"

#: ../../source/docs/common-holybro-kakutef4.rst:83
#: 6f88fefdace74f98afe7f1e2057d775d
msgid ":ref:`SERIAL2_OPTIONS<SERIAL2_OPTIONS>` 0"
msgstr ":ref:`SERIAL2_OPTIONS<SERIAL2_OPTIONS>` 0"

#: ../../source/docs/common-holybro-kakutef4.rst:86
#: 2c520af63c084291bf5ec2f3678341e4
msgid "OSD Support"
msgstr "OSD 支持"

#: ../../source/docs/common-holybro-kakutef4.rst:88
#: 34f38a543c42453b9817d875bfe383fc
msgid ""
"The KakuteF4 supports OSD using :ref:`OSD_TYPE<OSD_TYPE>` 1 (MAX7456 "
"driver)."
msgstr "KakuteF4 支持使用 :ref:`OSD_TYPE<OSD_TYPE>` 1（MAX7456 驱动）的 OSD。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-holybro-kakutef4.rst:91
#: 710c037ab7e74a67ae25fb623f665b5f
msgid "PWM Output"
msgstr "PWM 输出"

#: ../../source/docs/common-holybro-kakutef4.rst:93
#: ea74859edcfe4b0bb5b2880b5d586571
msgid ""
"The KakuteF4 supports up to 4 PWM outputs. The pads for motor output M1 to "
"M4 on the above diagram are for the 4 outputs. All 4 outputs support DShot "
"as well as all PWM types. The M5 and M6 outputs are not currently available "
"with ArduPilot."
msgstr ""
"KakuteF4 最多支持 4 路 PWM 输出。上图中电机输出 M1 到 M4 的焊盘对应 4 路输出。所有 4 路输出均支持 DShot 及所有 "
"PWM 类型。M5 和 M6 输出目前在 ArduPilot 中不可用。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-holybro-kakutef4.rst:98
#: 3216642fe55c4dbfb2dfe56e0320c91a
msgid "The PWM is in 2 groups:"
msgstr "PWM 分为 2 组："

#: ../../source/docs/common-holybro-kakutef4.rst:100
#: 29d6f521a01545b5b2c952638d7ad332
msgid "PWM 1 and 2 in group 1"
msgstr "PWM 1 和 2 为第 1 组"

#: ../../source/docs/common-holybro-kakutef4.rst:101
#: 1cd6576bb2de4ac2bec8d4a9d0f4d90b
msgid "PWM 3 and 4 in group 2"
msgstr "PWM 3 和 4 为第 2 组"

#: ../../source/docs/common-holybro-kakutef4.rst:103
#: 943ee095b40e4bd483138b3c0daef886
msgid ""
"Channels within the same group need to use the same output rate, whether PWM"
" or Dshot. If any channel in a group uses DShot then all channels in the "
"group need to use DShot."
msgstr ""
"同一组内的通道无论使用 PWM 还是 DShot 都必须使用相同的输出频率。若组内任一通道使用 DShot，则该组所有通道均需使用 DShot。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-holybro-kakutef4.rst:108
#: 8e4b6e6c44dc46f2abf2ac8124780247
msgid "Battery Monitoring"
msgstr "电池监测"

#: ../../source/docs/common-holybro-kakutef4.rst:110
#: 5fe3eb58135c4d1386df06f56bf6624a
msgid ""
"The board has a built-in voltage and current sensor. The voltage sensor can "
"handle up to 6S LiPo batteries."
msgstr "此板内置电压和电流传感器。电压传感器最多支持 6S LiPo 电池。"

