#: ../../source/docs/common-holybro-kakutef4.rst:122
#: 204b22445b5041d98bd74c4ee03a499d
msgid "Compass"
msgstr "罗盘"

#: ../../source/docs/common-holybro-kakutef4.rst:124
#: 1671fc2b0eb3459faa2827bf5dfc3f0b
msgid ""
"The KakuteF4 AIO does not have a built-in compass, but you can attach an "
"external compass using I2C on the SDA and SCL pads."
msgstr "KakuteF4 AIO 没有内置罗盘，但可以通过 SDA 和 SCL 焊盘上的 I2C 连接外部罗盘。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-holybro-kakutef4.rst:127
#: 6d07932611f9406dae0aa43a4983bd20
msgid "Logging"
msgstr "日志记录"

#: ../../source/docs/common-holybro-kakutef4.rst:129
#: 6f3fd87dc279485792907742007fa4ff
msgid "The KakuteF4 supports on-board data flash logging."
msgstr "KakuteF4 支持板载数据闪存日志记录。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-holybro-kakutef4.rst:132
#: 317cedd239e948788f539922561b389b
msgid "Firmware"
msgstr "固件"

#: ../../source/docs/common-holybro-kakutef4.rst:134
#: efdbbb41d2054f749b550d6313be2ec3
msgid ""
"Firmware for this board can be found `here "
"<https://firmware.ardupilot.org>`_ in  sub-folders labeled \"KakuteF4\"."
msgstr ""
"此板的固件可在 `此处 <https://firmware.ardupilot.org>`_ 找到，位于标注为「KakuteF4」的子文件夹中。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-holybro-kakutef4.rst:138
#: cd58a01c42ad477d8c528278966b4811
msgid "Loading ArduPilot onto the board"
msgstr "将 ArduPilot 加载到板上"

#: ../../source/docs/common-holybro-kakutef4.rst:140
#: ab0007255a1f486b9e5964e170b5bf1d
msgid ""
"Initial firmware load can be done with DFU by plugging in USB with the "
"bootloader button pressed. Then you should load the \"with_bl.hex\" "
"firmware, using your favourite DFU loading tool."
msgstr "初始固件加载可通过按住引导程序按钮插入USB以DFU方式完成。然后使用您喜欢的DFU加载工具加载「with_bl.hex」固件。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-holybro-kakutef4.rst:144
#: 23286b80f64f4aa2b601c90269f8f458
msgid ""
"Once the initial firmware is loaded you can update the firmware using any "
"ArduPilot ground station software. Updates should be done with the "
"xxxxxxxxxx.apj firmware files."
msgstr "初始固件加载完成后，可使用任意ArduPilot地面站软件更新固件。更新应使用xxxxxxxxxx.apj固件文件。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-holybro-kakutef4.rst:147
#: a03d9c73187141afbae0b4b8c33e98a4
msgid ""
"If you are using a Kospi1 you may wish to load the default parameter file "
"found `here "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/blob/master/Tools/Frame_params/Holybro-"
"kospi1.param>`__ or if you are using the Mission Planner it can be "
"conveniently loaded from the Config/Tuning >> Full Parameter Tree screen.  "
"Select \"Holybro-kospi1.param\" from the drop-down and then push the \"Load "
"Presaved\" button."
msgstr ""
"如果使用 Kospi1，您可能希望加载 `此处 "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/blob/master/Tools/Frame_params/Holybro-"
"kospi1.param>`__ 的默认参数文件，如果使用 Mission Planner，可以在 Config/Tuning >> Full "
"Parameter Tree 界面方便地加载。从下拉菜单选择「Holybro-kospi1.param」，然后点击「Load Presaved」按钮。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-holybro-kakutef4.rst:153
#: 6396167cd0ce4220b1101e9e09c7077a
msgid "Videos"
msgstr "视频"
